{"seq":4,"slug":"developmental-psychology","title":"发展心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.31,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"发展心理学-简介\">发展心理学 简介</h1><p>发展心理学研究人类从受孕到死亡整个生命周期中心理与行为的变化规律。这门学科不仅关注&quot;人在某个年龄段是什么样的&quot;，更深入探究&quot;变化是如何发生的&quot;以及&quot;为什么会这样变化&quot;。本模块面向希望理解人类成长全貌的技术从业者和终身学习者，帮助读者建立对毕生发展的科学认知框架，并将这些知识应用到育儿实践、团队协作、自我管理和职业规划中。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>产前期与婴儿期</strong>从生命的起点出发，介绍胎儿在子宫中的发育历程与早期经验对后续发展的深远影响，探讨婴儿惊人的认知能力、依恋关系的形成机制，以及气质差异如何为个体发展奠定生物学基调。这一章揭示了人生最初两年如何为整个生命周期的心理发展铺设基础。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>儿童期发展</strong>聚焦于从幼儿到青春期前这一关键阶段。从皮亚杰的认知发展阶段理论到维果茨基的最近发展区概念，从道德推理能力的逐步成熟到语言系统的爆发式增长，本章呈现儿童如何在思维、道德和语言三个维度上实现质的飞跃。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>青少年期</strong>深入这个充满剧变与探索的人生阶段。从埃里克森的同一性理论出发，解析青少年如何在自我认同的迷雾中找到方向，揭示前额叶皮层尚未完全发育对行为的深层影响，剖析同伴关系的巨大塑造力，以及冒险行为背后的神经发展逻辑。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>成年期与老龄化</strong>跨越成年早期到生命晚期的漫长旅程。从新兴成人期的独特挑战，到中年转型期的重新定位，从认知老化的科学机制与应对策略，到成功老龄化的多维模型，本章帮助读者理解成年后的持续发展与变化。</p>\n<p>第5章<strong>毕生发展主题</strong>超越具体年龄段，探讨贯穿整个生命周期的核心议题。先天与后天的交互作用、发展的连续性与阶段性之争、跨越逆境的心理韧性，以及死亡与临终的心理过程，这些主题将前四章的知识整合为一个完整的毕生发展图景。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：按照从第1章到第5章的顺序阅读，这一安排遵循了人类生命的自然时间线。前四章帮助读者建立对各发展阶段的具体认知，第5章则提供跨阶段的整合视角。如果时间有限，可以优先阅读与自身当前生命阶段最相关的章节，再回头补充其他部分。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prenatal-infancy","title":"产前期与婴儿期","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/prenatal-infancy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prenatal-development","title":"产前发展与胎儿心理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/prenatal-infancy/prenatal-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"infant-cognition","title":"婴儿认知发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/prenatal-infancy/infant-cognition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attachment-theory","title":"依恋理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/prenatal-infancy/attachment-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"temperament","title":"气质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/prenatal-infancy/temperament"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"childhood","title":"儿童期发展","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/childhood","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"piaget-stages","title":"皮亚杰认知发展阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/childhood/piaget-stages"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vygotsky-zone","title":"维果茨基最近发展区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/childhood/vygotsky-zone"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-development","title":"道德发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/childhood/moral-development"},{"seq":4,"slug":"language-development","title":"语言发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/childhood/language-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"adolescence","title":"青少年期","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adolescence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-formation","title":"同一性形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adolescence/identity-formation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adolescent-brain","title":"青少年大脑发育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adolescence/adolescent-brain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"peer-influence","title":"同伴影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adolescence/peer-influence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"risk-taking-behavior","title":"冒险行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adolescence/risk-taking-behavior"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"adulthood-aging","title":"成年期与老龄化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adulthood-aging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emerging-adulthood","title":"新兴成人期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/developmental-psychology/adulthood-aging/emerging-adulthood"},{"seq":2,"slug":"midlife-transitions","title":"中年转型","url":"/l-doc-b